---
title: VFS 虚拟文件系统架构图
type: graph
tags: [文件系统, VFS, 架构]
description: VFS 四大核心对象(super_block/inode/dentry/file)与底层文件系统、页缓存的关系
---
graph TB
    subgraph 用户层
        App[应用程序<br/>read/write/open]
    end

    subgraph VFS["VFS 虚拟文件系统(公共接口层)"]
        SysCall[系统调用<br/>do_sys_open / vfs_read]
        File[file 结构体<br/>+ file_operations<br/>read_iter/write_iter]
        Dentry[dentry 目录项<br/>路径 → inode 缓存]
        Inode[inode 索引节点<br/>+ inode_operations<br/>文件元数据]
        Super[super_block 超级块<br/>+ super_operations<br/>挂载信息]
    end

    subgraph 底层
        Ext4[ext4 / xfs / btrfs<br/>具体文件系统实现]
        Block[块设备驱动<br/>submit_bio]
    end

    subgraph 性能层
        PageCache[页缓存 page cache<br/>address_space<br/>脏页回写]
    end

    App --> SysCall
    SysCall --> File
    File --> Dentry
    Dentry --> Inode
    Inode --> Super
    File -.-> PageCache
    Inode -.-> PageCache
    Super --> Ext4
    Inode --> Ext4
    PageCache --> Block
    Ext4 --> Block
